### Staff Scans Attendee QR
POST http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/scan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <STAFF_TOKEN>

{
  "qrToken": "EFQR-7a8f9b2c3d4e5f60",
  "eventId": "66d000000000000000000001"
}

### Record Session Attendance
POST http://localhost:5000/api/attendance/session
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <STAFF_TOKEN>

{
  "sessionId": "66d000000000000000000015",
  "attendeeId": "66d000000000000000000010",
  "method": "qr"
}
